    "body": "FAE is a category (a set of elements). As such the essential part of its definition is not that text, but the list below. Which is also why FACE needs to be defined in terms of ACE and the specific bit set on the definition.\r\n\r\nForm control / widget is probably something that needs to be cleaned up at some point, yes.",
